tion\tof\tcertain\tBlackRock\tLTIP\tprograms,\ta\tforward\tpurchase\tcommitment\tfor\tcertain\tloans\tupon\tconversion\tfrom\ta\tvariable\trate\tto\ta\tfixed\trate,\tand\tthe\tswaps\tentered\tinto in\tconnection\twith\tsales\tof\ta\tportion\tof\tVisa\tClass\tB\tcommon\tshares\tin\t2012.\n\nGains\t(losses)\ton\tderivative\tinstruments\tand\trelated\thedged\titems\tfollow:\n\n# Table\t134:\tDerivatives\tDesignated\tin\tGAAP\tHedge\tRelationships\t–\tFair\tValue\tHedges\n\n|  |  |  | December\t31,\t2012 |  | December\t31,\t2011 | December\t31,\t2011 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n|  |  |  |  | Gain\\t(Loss) |  | Gain\\t(Loss) |\n|  |  |  | Gain | on\\tRelated | Gain | on\\tRelated |\n|  |  |  | (Loss)\\ton | Hedged | (Loss)\\ton | Hedged |\n|  |  |  | Derivatives | Items | Derivatives | Items |\n|  |  |  | Recognized | Recognized | Recognized | Recognized |\n| Year\\tended |  |  | in\\tIncome | in\\tIncome | in\\tIncome | in\\tIncome |\n| In\\tmillions | Hedged\\tItems | Location | Amount | Amount | Amount | Amount |\n| Interest\\trate\\tcontracts | US\\tTreasury\\tand | Investment\\tsecurities |  |  |  |  |\n|  | Government\\tAgencies | (interest\\tincome) |  |  |  |  |\n|  | Securities |  | $(26) | $23 | $(153) | $162 |\n| Interest\\trate\\tcontracts | Other\\tDebt\\tSecurities | Investment\\tsecurities |  |  |  |  |\n|  |  | (interest\\tincome) | (1) | 1 | (23) | 23 |\n| Interest\\trate\\tcontracts | Subordinated\\tdebt | Borrowed\\tfunds |  |  |  |  |\n|  |  | (interest\\texpense) | (30) | (9) | 214 | (229) |\n| Interest\\trate\\tcontracts | Bank\\tnotes\\tand | Borrowed\\tfunds |  |  |  |  |\n|  | senior\\tdebt | (interest\\texpense) | 68 | (80) | 265 | (276) |\n| Total |  |  | $11 | $(65) | $303 | $(320) |\n\n# Table\t135:\tDerivatives\tDesignated\tin\tGAAP\tHedge\tRelationships\t–\tCash\tFlow\tHedges\n\n| Year\tended\tIn\tmillions | Gain\t(Loss)\ton\tDerivatives<br>Recognized\tin\tOCI<br>(Effective\tPortion) | Gain\t(Loss)\tReclassified\t