marily\tdue\tto\ta\t$106.9\tmillion\tincrease\tin\tdigital mammography\tsystem\tsales,\ta\t$19.5\tmillion\tincrease\tin\tMulticare\tstereotactic\ttable\tsales\tand\t$12.1\tmillion\tof\tproduct\tsales\tfrom\tR2\tand\tSuros,\tentities\tacquired\tin\tthe fourth\tquarter\tof\tfiscal\t2006.\tThese\tincreases\twere\tpartially\toffset\tby\ta\t$4.8\tmillion\tdecrease\tin\tanalog\tmammography\tsystems\tsales.\tThe\tincrease\tin\tour\tdigital mammography\tproduct\tsales\twas\tprimarily\tattributable\tto\tan\tincrease\tin\tthe\tnumber\tof\tSelenia\tsystems\tsold\tworldwide.\tIn\tfiscal\t2006,\twe\tsold\t555\tdigital mammography\tsystems\tcompared\tto\t239\tsystems\tin\tfiscal\t2005.\tWe\tattribute\tthe\tincrease\tin\tdigital\tmammography\tsystem\tsales\tprimarily\tto\tthe\tgrowing\tacceptance\tof our\tSelenia\tmammography\tsystem\tand\tof\tdigital\tmammography\tin\tgeneral.\tThe\tincrease\tin\tMulticare\tstereotactic\ttables\twas\tprimarily\tattributable\tto\tan\tincrease\tin\tthe number\tof\tsystems\tsold\tworldwide\tin\tthe\tcurrent\tfiscal\tyear\tcompared\tto\tfiscal\t2005.\tWe\tattribute\tthis\tincrease\tat\tleast\tin\tpart,\tto\tour\tacquisition\tof\tthe\tMammotest intellectual\tproperty\tfrom\tFischer.\tThe\tdecrease\tin\tsales\tof\tour\tanalog\tmammography\tsystems\twas\tprimarily\tattributable\tto\ta\tdecrease\tin\tthe\tnumber\tof\tsystems\tsold both\tdomestically\tand\tin\tEurope,\tpartially\toffset\tby\tan\tincrease\tin\tunits\tsold\tin\tother\tinternational\tmarkets\tcombined\twith\ta\tdecrease\tin\taverage\tselling\tprice\tin\tall markets.\tWe\tbelieve\tthat\tthis\tdecrease\tin\tanalog\tsystem\tsales\twas\tprimarily\tdue\tto\tthe\tshift\tin\tproduct\tsales\tto\tdigital\tsystems.\n\nOsteoporosis\tassessment\tproduct\tsales\tincreased\t6%\tin\tfiscal\t2006\tcompared\tto\tfiscal\t2005.\tThis\tincrease\twas\tprimarily\tdue\tto\tan\tincrease\tin\tthe\tnumber\tof systems\tsold\tin\tthe\tUnited\tStates\tand\tan\tincrease\tin\tthe\tnumber\tof\tour\tlower-priced\tExplorer\t